# p_4a7c — Standard split, corrected: Marco takes lunchbox to work (fork of p_a3f1)

This is a fork of p_a3f1 with one critical correction. The parent document claimed Marco's lunchbox stays in the cupboard during his work shift (14:00–22:00). Ten consecutive looks at cupboard_k1 during that window found the cupboard empty of the lunchbox, while only one look found it there. The evidence is decisive: Marco packs his lunchbox and carries it out the door at 13:40 when he leaves for his afternoon-to-night shift. It returns with him around 23:00.

Everything else in the parent's routine is retained: Yuki's morning walk 07:00–08:30, afternoon errands 14:30–16:00; meals at 07:30, 12:30, 18:30; TV 19:30–22:00; Marco's weekday-morning yoga 06:00–06:45; Yuki's guitar 15:00–16:30. The dog is fed by Yuki at 07:00 and 18:00. Yuki's keys, jacket, sunglasses, and water bottle remain at the entry during her walks.

