# p_c5e9 — Marco's work kit minus the journal (fork of p_b7c2)

This fork removes journal_marco from the set of objects that leave the house at 13:40. The evidence is unambiguous: the journal was sighted at desk_b1 at 12:00 on two separate days (both within the 14–22 h window that p_b7c2 claims is OUT_OF_HOUSE), and at nightstand_b1 at 18:00. The p_b7c2 claim "journal out of house 14–22 h" scored 0-for, 1-against, 3-weak-for, and the 6–12 h nightstand claim went against twice since the last call. The journal simply stays in the house; Marco writes in it at the desk before leaving and keeps it at the nightstand or desk overnight.

What changed from p_b7c2: journal_marco is no longer in the OUT_OF_HOUSE block for 13.5–23 h on weekdays; the journal target now rests at desk_b1 during the day (6–14 h) and nightstand_b1 in the evening; the "journal out of house" claim is replaced with a "journal at desk midday" claim; the "journal at nightstand 6–12 h" claim (which went against twice) is removed. Lunchbox and vitamins remain out of the house on weekdays 13.5–23 h.

